  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Venue Announcements**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Subterranea**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Golden Lady**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Big Brother**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Evidence**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Shaheed, Bridge To Bama, Who Knows [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2000-04-20.schoeps.ccm4** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 144 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2000-04-20.schoeps.ccm4**: taped by Paul deLima; transferred by Paul deLima; source: (stage lip) Schoeps CCM4 (ORTF) > Grace Design Lunatec V2 > Sony TCD-D8 @ 16bit 48.0kHz [1]. Also: Transfer ran from DAT through a Panasonic SV-3800 and s/pdif into a PC, then Cool Edit Pro, CD-R, EAC, Sound Forge, and FLAC; Taper trimmed some track beginnings and ends and merged tracks during editing; Paul deLima recorded, transferred and uploaded it to the LMA [1]",
